# --- Unity AI (Assistant / Generators) scratch ---
# GeneratedAssets/ is the generator's local cache: every model+image it ever made,
# including *_deleted/ folders for stuff you already threw away, plus .json sidecars
# holding the prompt history. Megabytes of churn, none of it the project. The assets
# you actually keep get imported into Assets/ — commit those, not the cache.
Unity/GeneratedAssets/
Unity/Assets/AI Toolkit/
Unity/Assets/AI Toolkit.meta

# --- Third-party asset packs kept OUT of git ---
# Large Asset Store packs we're only trialling. Share via Drive, not the repo,
# so we don't burn LFS quota or bloat history. Each dev imports them locally.
# If a pack graduates to "we're actually shipping this", remove its line here
# and commit it properly (LFS-tracked) — and tell the other dev.
Unity/Assets/09RetroBowl/
Unity/Assets/09RetroBowl.meta

